    "type": "game",
    "name": "CINESCAPE VR",
    "steam_appid": 3779710,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>CINESCAPE-VR </strong>is a puzzle game that invites you to explore a variety of themed film studios. Thanks to your unique power, <strong>Cinemorphosis</strong>, you can turn real objects into fake props and vice versa. This power evolves and grows stronger as your adventure progresses. A series of intricate <strong>puzzles</strong> awaits you, increasing in complexity the further you advance.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features :\u00a0</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive controls \u2013 literally. No controllers needed: your own hands are enough, thanks to hand tracking (if supported by your headset) !</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your companion throughout the adventure is <strong>P4-TRIC</strong>, a robotic assistant built by the former director of the studios. He\u2019s here to guide you through the tests\u2026 but behind his advice and encouragement may lie a hidden plan..</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your journey unfolds, a deeper truth emerges. You may not be who you thought you were, and the studio\u2019s founder may have had far more personal reasons for designing these trials.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the adventure. Wield your new power \u2013 <strong>CINEMORPHOSIS </strong>\u2013 and uncover the mysteries of the studios..</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each environment is filled with subtle cinematic references, carefully placed for film buffs to discover.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission? </strong>Restore<strong> the Codex</strong> and uncover the secrets it holds by following in the footsteps of its mysterious creator.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>CINESCAPE-VR </strong>is a puzzle game that invites you to explore a variety of themed film studios. Thanks to your unique power, <strong>Cinemorphosis</strong>, you can turn real objects into fake props and vice versa. This power evolves and grows stronger as your adventure progresses. A series of intricate <strong>puzzles</strong> awaits you, increasing in complexity the further you advance.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features :\u00a0</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive controls \u2013 literally. No controllers needed: your own hands are enough, thanks to hand tracking (if supported by your headset) !</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your companion throughout the adventure is <strong>P4-TRIC</strong>, a robotic assistant built by the former director of the studios. He\u2019s here to guide you through the tests\u2026 but behind his advice and encouragement may lie a hidden plan..</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your journey unfolds, a deeper truth emerges. You may not be who you thought you were, and the studio\u2019s founder may have had far more personal reasons for designing these trials.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the adventure. Wield your new power \u2013 <strong>CINEMORPHOSIS </strong>\u2013 and uncover the mysteries of the studios..</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each environment is filled with subtle cinematic references, carefully placed for film buffs to discover.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission? </strong>Restore<strong> the Codex</strong> and uncover the secrets it holds by following in the footsteps of its mysterious creator.</p>",
    "short_description": "CINESCAPE-VR is a virtual reality escape game where you must solve puzzles within film studio sets, using the power of Cinemorphosis \u2013 a unique ability that lets you transform the objects around you \u2013 to uncover the secrets of the Cinetech company.",
